   "text": "'We help brands grow.' So does every agency in town. Say what only you do.\n\nWhat a marketing agency website needs:\n1. Services with a scope and a price\n2. Case studies as short cards\n3. A team page that earns its place\n4. An intake with three questions\n\n📌 Save this for when you update your site.\n\nDescribe your business in plain language and get a free preview in about 30 seconds, no sign-up. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#marketingagency #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
