   "text": "A website prompt for a designer. Copy it and change the details:\n\n\"Freelance brand designer in Copenhagen. Quiet, lots of white space. Logos and packaging for food brands, nothing else. Selected work, about, availability and rates, email.\"\n\nWho and where, the mood, what's different, what to show. Write it in your own language: the copy follows it.\n\n📌 Send this to someone who runs a small business.\n\nTry it with one sentence: free preview, no sign-up, about 30 seconds. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#designportfolio #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
